    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "mweri na mĩthenya",
      "rationale": "Mũthenya wa kwambĩrĩria na mũthenya wa kũũka kwarĩmũrĩtwo kwa njĩra ya kũbarĩra mĩthenya na mĩeri."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "יסד",
      "rationale": "Kiugo gĩkũhĩ kũmanĩna 'kũikara thĩ kĩhingo'; ta ũguo ũtheri wa maũndũ — 'kwoambĩrĩirie' handũ ha 'nĩwo kĩhingo kĩa kũgũrũka' (YLt)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "nĩ gũkorũo",
      "rationale": "כי ĩrĩa ĩrũngĩrĩire ũhoro-inĩ nĩĩongeretwo nĩ Gĩkũyũ gothe kũhotosia mũhoro."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Nĩ gũkorũo mũthenya-inĩ wa mbere wa mweri wa mbere nĩho kũgũrũka kuuma Baberi kwoambĩrĩirie, na mũthenya-inĩ wa mbere wa mweri wa gatano nĩakĩũra Yerucarayimu, ta ⟨mũndũ ũrĩa Erohimu wake aamũhe⟩ mkono mwega ũrĩa warĩ igũrũ rĩake.",
